              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{2}\\cos (x+\\frac{\\pi}{4})-\\sin x=\\left|\\cos x\\right|\"></span>. </li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Ука­жи­те корни этого урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[19\\pi;\\frac{41\\pi}{2}]\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T17:46:38.323529+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{2\\pi k;-\\frac{3\\pi}{4}+2\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{77\\pi}{4}\"></span> ,  <span data-inline-latex=\"20\\pi\"></span> .</p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T17:46:38.323529+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Пре­об­ра­зу­ем урав­не­ние:<center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{2}\\cos (x+\\frac{\\pi}{4})-\\sin x=\\left|\\cos x\\right|\\iff \\cos x-2\\sin x=\\left|\\cos x\\right|\"></span>. </p></center><p>При  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos x\\ge 0\"></span>, по­лу­чим <span data-inline-latex=\"2\\sin x=0\\iff x=\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . Усло­вию  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos x\\ge 0\"></span> со­от­вет­ству­ет толь­ко <span data-inline-latex=\"x=2\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> .</p><p>При  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos x\\lt 0\"></span> по­лу­чим</p><center><p> <img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"32a56c9f-c8e2-4a64-a8bf-0226f6e4595c\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p><p><span data-inline-latex=\"2\\cos x-2\\sin x=0\\iff \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cos x-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\sin x=0\\iff \\cos (x+\\frac{\\pi}{4})=0\\iff x+\\frac{\\pi}{4}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k,\\quad k\\in \\mathbb{Z}\\iff x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </p><p></p></center><p>Усло­вию  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos x\\lt 0\"></span> со­от­вет­ству­ет толь­ко <span data-inline-latex=\"x=-\\frac{3\\pi}{4}+2\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </p></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Для от­бо­ра кор­ней ис­поль­зу­ем еди­нич­ную окруж­ность. На за­дан­ном про­ме­жут­ке лежат корни  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{77\\pi}{4}\"></span>  и <span data-inline-latex=\"20\\pi\"></span> .</li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1"
                ]
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            },
