              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p><nobr>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{\\pi+2\\pi k;\\frac{5\\pi}{4}+2\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ; </nobr> <nobr>б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\pi\"></span> ,  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{5\\pi}{4}\"></span> . </nobr></p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T18:29:06.371302+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"03441807-bcb7-4f5b-94aa-b64c7b5db62e\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p><p>а)  Пре­об­ра­зу­ем урав­не­ние:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left|\\cos x-2\\sin x\\right|=-\\cos x\\iff \\begin{cases}\\cos x\\le 0\\\\\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos x-2\\sin x=\\cos x\\\\\\cos x-2\\sin x=-\\cos x\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\begin{cases}\\cos x\\le 0\\\\\\left[\\begin{aligned}2\\sin x=0\\\\\\cos x=\\sin x\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}\\cos x\\le 0\\\\\\left[\\begin{aligned}x=\\pi k\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=\\pi+2\\pi k\\\\x=\\frac{5\\pi}{4}+2\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right..k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </span></p></center><p>б)  От­бе­рем корни при по­мо­щи еди­нич­ной окруж­но­сти (см. рис.). Под­хо­дят <nobr>числа  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\pi\"></span> </nobr> и  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{5\\pi}{4}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
